  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGraph the line \u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 6.2\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e – 98 on your calculator. Use the \u003ci\u003eTrace\u003c/i\u003e function to quickly find the value of \u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e for \u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 5.82, \u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 5.84, and \u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 5.86.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eEnter the function.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20820\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20820\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e and enter the function for Y\u003csub\u003e1\u003c/sub\u003e. Key in \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20821\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q6.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20822\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qdot.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20822\u0026quot;,135)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20823\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20824\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qx73.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20824\u0026quot;,263)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20825\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qminus.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20825\u0026quot;,185)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20826\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q9.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20827\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q8.gif\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-1 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_10_1_linearequationsandinequalities_4_90/f-90-4-1.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cdiv class\u003d\"question\"\u003e\n  \u003cp\u003eWhat would be an appropriate viewing window for this graph?\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003c/div\u003e\n \u003cdiv class\u003d\"question_guess\"\u003e\n  \u003cimg onmouseover\u003d\"doQuestionResponse(\u0027rid_4648\u0027,\u0027no\u0027);\" onmouseout\u003d\"doQuestionResponseEnd();\" src\u003d\"/images/tutor5/hint_question-16x16.gif\" name\u003d\"question_0\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\n  \u003cp\u003eXmin \u003d –10, Xmax \u003d 10, Xscl \u003d 1, Ymin \u003d –10, Ymax \u003d 10, Yscl \u003d 1\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003c/div\u003e\n \u003cdiv class\u003d\"question_guess\"\u003e\n  \u003cimg onmouseover\u003d\"doQuestionResponse(\u0027rid_4649\u0027,\u0027yes\u0027);\" onmouseout\u003d\"doQuestionResponseEnd();\" src\u003d\"/images/tutor5/hint_question-16x16.gif\" name\u003d\"question_1\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\n  \u003cp\u003eXmin \u003d –10, Xmax \u003d 10, Xscl \u003d 1, Ymin \u003d –200, Ymax \u003d 0, Yscl \u003d 10\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003c/div\u003e\n \u003cdiv class\u003d\"question_guess\"\u003e\n  \u003cimg onmouseover\u003d\"doQuestionResponse(\u0027rid_4650\u0027,\u0027no\u0027);\" onmouseout\u003d\"doQuestionResponseEnd();\" src\u003d\"/images/tutor5/hint_question-16x16.gif\" name\u003d\"question_2\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\n  \u003cp\u003eXmin \u003d –200, Xmax \u003d 200, Xscl \u003d 50, Ymin \u003d –200, Ymax \u003d 0, Yscl \u003d 10\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20828\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qwindow.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20828\u0026quot;,255)\"\u003e and set the viewing window to about Xmin \u003d –10, Xmax \u003d 10, Xscl \u003d 1, Ymin \u003d –200, Ymax \u003d 0, Yscl \u003d 10. (Or, just use \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20829\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qzoom.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20829\u0026quot;,267)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20830\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q9.gif\"\u003e to fit the intercepts in the screen.)\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-3 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_10_1_linearequationsandinequalities_4_90/f-90-4-2.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
